{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Behold the children of Israel did not listen to me.</b> Moses did not realize that it was because of shortness of spirit that they did not listen, and therefore he said <b>behold the children of Israel did not listen to me.</b> Therefore it says 'and He commanded them concerning the children of Israel' — meaning that because of shortness of spirit they did not listen, and therefore Moses answered HaShem, blessed be He, in the second passage, 'because I am of uncircumcised lips' — He did not send me back, until He said to him, 'and Aaron your brother shall be your prophet.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:56:21.201944921Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}